{"unit_id":"corrinehu__dsh-chat-imagine#card-zh","repo":"corrinehu/dsh-chat-imagine","commit":"2b54498963382690703692c3397c3f11723674d5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-imagine 是面向 DSH Web 聊天的生图与识图插件。它注册工具来探测可用渠道、生成图片、保存默认渠道，并把图片解析为结构化证据。生图可调用 DSH 已配置的 OpenAI 兼容 API，也可使用本机 mmx、codex 或 agy CLI；识图通过 CLI 输出 OCR、阅读顺序版面、语义实体、视觉说明和不确定项。生成结果以内联图片引用显示，图片暂存在进程内存。适合在聊天中按描述创作图片，或让文本模型读取截图、图表和扫描件。使用 API 需先配置兼容渠道；CLI 功能需安装相应工具及其账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:557-590","index.js:921-950","index.js:1139-1177"]}
{"unit_id":"corrinehu__dsh-chat-imagine#card-en","repo":"corrinehu/dsh-chat-imagine","commit":"2b54498963382690703692c3397c3f11723674d5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chat-imagine adds image generation and reading to DSH Web chat. It uses configured APIs or local CLIs to create inline images, and reads screenshots into OCR and structured visual evidence. API use needs a configured provider; CLI use needs the relevant local tool.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:557-590","index.js:921-950","index.js:1139-1177"]}
