{"unit_id":"corrinehu__dsh-chat-imagine#caveat-1","repo":"corrinehu/dsh-chat-imagine","commit":"2b54498963382690703692c3397c3f11723674d5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-imagine 使用前须知：识图依赖本机 mmx、codex 或 agy CLI；生成图片仅缓存在 DSH 进程内存，进程重启后旧图片链接失效。（见 index.js:113-143）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:113-143","index.js:921-950"]}
